{"id": "38104", "title": "走下坡路的男人", "author": "盖伊·C·范德海格", "category": "文学名著", "count": 56, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/38/38104/38104s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/38/38104.htm", "intro": "本书是一部由12个短篇故事组成的短篇小说集。作者把悲天悯人的目光投向一群走在人生道路的下坡路上的男人，他们大多在职场上失意，在家庭中落魄，被朋友视为怪物，被家人当成负担，但他们内心却自恃英勇，不甘沉沦，自豪然而却徒劳地试图改变每况愈下的痛苦人生。这12个故事相对独立又相互关联，描写加拿大现代社会中的男人面临羞辱、嘲讽、伤害、挫折、失败和死亡时的心态和情感。该作品曾荣获加拿大总督文学奖和英国费伯奖。", "base": "files/article/html/38/38104", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第1节：看客(1)", "file": "3060944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2节：看客(2)", "file": "3060945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3节：看客(3)", "file": "3060946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4节：看客(4)", "file": "3060947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5节：看客(5)", "file": "3060948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6节：看客(6)", "file": "3060949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7节：看客(7)", "file": "3060950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8节：看客(8)", "file": "3060951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9节：看客(9)", "file": "3060952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10节：看客(10)", "file": "3060953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11节：看客(11)", "file": "3060954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12节：看客(12)", "file": "3060955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13节：看客(13)", "file": "3060956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14节：看客(14)", "file": "3060957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15节：看客(15)", "file": "3060958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16节：看客(16)", "file": "3060959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17节：看客(17)", "file": "3060960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18节：看客(18)", "file": "3060961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19节：看客(19)", "file": "3060962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20节：看客(20)", "file": "3060963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21节：看客(21)", "file": "3060964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume